 qml6-module-qtqml,
Description: macOS-style top status bar for Lingmo OS
 A full-width status bar pinned to the top edge of the screen. It shows the
 application name of the active window on the left, a clock with a calendar
 popup in the middle, and tray placeholders plus a system menu on the right.
 .
 The global menu and the real system tray are not implemented yet; both are
 planned for the second phase.
